# Minted feed signing keys. `cascade_feed_keyset.py` writes the SERVER'S PRIVATE
# signing key here — the one thing that lets anyone forge geometry our buyers
# would trade on. It was untracked but not ignored, so a stray `git add out/`
# would have published it. The tool tells you to delete these once they are on
# the server; this is the guard for the gap in between.
out/

